# QA Agent Forgejo PR Auto-Fire Prompt

## Auth And Forgejo Session
Use the Forgejo and taskboard session credentials bound to this run. Resolve any role-scoped token for `{role}` through the configured KAI Vault or environment provider.

Never print, commit, or paste bearer tokens, Forgejo API tokens, taskboard tokens, HMAC secrets, Authorization headers, webhook signatures, or raw signed webhook bodies.

